[node name="Details" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="FenceTable" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(180, 412)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("6_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at Rook's Table"
flag_to_set = "rook_buyer_slate_seen"
discovery_text = "[b]The back table under Rook's awning[/b]

Nothing on it is honest and everything is well kept: a merchant's signet with the device filed off, a silver chalice with the Dawn's sun on it from some country chapel, a short sword with a hammer-and-thorn smith's mark.

Chalked on the board behind, in a quick young hand, a list of buyers by nickname. Most take goods. One takes only papers: \"[i]The lady on the hill. Deeds, mortgages, valley land. Pays in gold, never comes herself.[/i]\""
reexamine_text = "The lady on the hill buys only valley deeds."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/FenceTable"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_140x46")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/FenceTable"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
offset_left = -90.0
offset_top = -56.0
offset_right = 90.0
offset_bottom = -31.0
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Look at Rook's Table"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="FloodMarks" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-306, -60)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("6_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Flood-Wall"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Marks on the flood-wall[/b]

Notches for the high waters, each with a year. Above them, scratched into the stone by many hands, names. Hundreds. A woman's name with four smaller ones under it. A man's with a drawing of a boat.

Across the top, in letters a hand high: [i]GREY YEAR. NO LANTERN FOR US.[/i]"
reexamine_text = "The Warrens' own memorial for the Grey Fever."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/FloodMarks"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_50x120")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/FloodMarks"]
